                        "\n\n"
                        "[FILE ACTION REQUIRED] This request needs a REAL file change, "
                        "not a description. Pasting, quoting, or restating the file's "
                        "code in your natural-language explanation -- even if you "
                        "consider it 'improved' -- does NOT count as fulfilling this "
                        "request and is NOT an acceptable response here. You must call "
