            (
                "The text below is the START of a file that got cut off "
                "mid-generation because it hit a token budget. Continue "
                "EXACTLY from where it stops \u2014 do not repeat any of it, do "
                "not add explanations, headers, or markdown code fences, "
                "just the remaining content needed to complete the file:\n\n"
            )
